### RaceDay API sample requests (VS Code REST Client / similar).
### Base URL assumes `dotnet run --project RaceDay.API` (http://localhost:5220).
### Sessions are cookies: after each /login the session cookie is replaced,
### so log in again before switching between the organiser and participant flows.

### 1. Browse events - works without logging in
GET http://localhost:5220/api/events

### 2. Register an organiser
POST http://localhost:5220/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Demo Organiser",
  "email": "demo-organiser@raceday.co.za",
  "password": "Demo123!",
  "role": "Organiser"
}

### 3. Register a participant
POST http://localhost:5220/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Demo Participant",
  "email": "demo-participant@raceday.co.za",
  "password": "Demo123!",
  "role": "Participant"
}

### 4. Log in as the organiser (server sets the session cookie)
POST http://localhost:5220/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo-organiser@raceday.co.za",
  "password": "Demo123!"
}

### 5. Create an event (organiser session)
POST http://localhost:5220/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventName": "Demo 10K",
  "description": "A demo run",
  "eventDate": "2026-12-05T09:00:00",
  "location": "Campus Park",
  "distance": "10km",
  "eventType": "Run"
}

### 6. Add a category to event 1 (organiser session)
POST http://localhost:5220/api/events/1/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryName": "10km Open",
  "maxParticipants": 100,
  "entryFee": 50
}

### 7. See the organiser's own event enrolments
GET http://localhost:5220/api/events/1/enrolments

### 8. Capture a result for enrolment 1 (organiser session)
POST http://localhost:5220/api/events/1/results
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "enrolmentId": 1,
  "finishTime": "00:45:30",
  "position": 1,
  "status": "Finished"
}

### 9. Log in as the participant (replaces the session cookie)
POST http://localhost:5220/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo-participant@raceday.co.za",
  "password": "Demo123!"
}

### 10. Enrol in category 1 (participant session)
POST http://localhost:5220/api/categories/1/enrol

### 11. Own enrolments (participant session)
GET http://localhost:5220/api/users/enrolments

### 12. Own results (any logged-in user)
GET http://localhost:5220/api/users/results

### 13. Own profile (any logged-in user)
GET http://localhost:5220/api/users/profile

### 14. Log out - the session cookie no longer works after this
POST http://localhost:5220/api/auth/logout
